## Note on authorship

This project was **generated by an AI coding agent** (a DeepSeek Harness agent
session) and reviewed, tested, and published by ZephyrAssa.

Every capability claim in the README is backed by an automated test in `lib/`
that runs on real Windows. The test suites total 136 checks. Findings that could
not be verified are explicitly marked as unverified rather than asserted.

You are free to use, modify, and redistribute this code under the MIT terms
above. If you rely on it in a context where correctness is critical, run the
test suites yourself on your own Windows build — behavior is verified only on
the configuration described in `docs/COMPATIBILITY.md`.
